# Agent board

At the start of a session that might change this repo, read `scratchpad/agents/BOARD.md`.

If you did work the other agent should know about, update `BOARD.md` and append `scratchpad/agents/log.md`. Sign as `grok`.

Claim files you are editing in the Locks table; clear them when done. Put questions for Claude in Inbox.

Do not embed GIFs that are not 800×480 without checking the board — see the Do not section there.
